<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="heading">班级学情概览</text><text>固定教材与统计窗口，不将不同学科混算。窗口按 UTC 固定，页面时刻用本机时区显示。</text><button bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新当前报告</button><button bindtap="web" disabled="{{busy}}">网页调整范围 / 重算入口</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}<button bindtap="login">核对身份</button></view><text wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">正在核对当前来源和快照…</text>
  <block wx:if="{{head}}"><view class="card"><text class="heading">请求第 {{head.generation}} 代 · {{head.job.label}}</text><text>本轮计算 {{head.job.completed}} / {{head.job.students}} 人 · 最近心跳 {{head.job.heartbeat}}</text><text wx:if="{{head.job.status === 3}}">失败阶段：{{head.job.stage}}</text><text wx:if="{{head.job.capacity}}">超出当前容量，请在网页缩小范围后新建报告。</text><text>窗口 {{head.from}} 至 {{head.to}}（不含结束）</text><text class="notice">{{head.warning}}</text></view>
    <block wx:if="{{head.current}}"><button bindtap="trend" disabled="{{busy}}">查看班级历次测评成绩</button><view class="card"><text class="heading">{{head.className}} · {{head.subject}}</text><text>{{head.book}}</text><text>展示快照第 {{head.snapshotGeneration}} 代 · 计算时间 {{head.calculated}}</text><text class="muted">计算口径 {{head.calculationVersion}}。确认评分不等于已向学生发布。</text>
        <text>当前纳入学生 {{head.coverage.students}} 人；至少有一项完整确认评分 {{head.coverage.scoredStudents}} 人</text><text>分配测评 {{head.coverage.assignedCount}} 人次；完整确认评分 {{head.coverage.scoredCount}} 人次</text><text>尚未开始 {{head.coverage.notStartedCount}} · 作答中 {{head.coverage.inProgressCount}} · 等待封存 {{head.coverage.awaitingSealCount}} 人次</text><text>待完整批改 {{head.coverage.pendingGradingCount}} · 缺考 {{head.coverage.absentCount}} · 提交在窗口外 {{head.coverage.outsideWindowCount}} 人次</text><text class="muted">同一学生多次测评分别计入人次；缺失状态不作为零分。</text>
        <view wx:if="{{head.rule}}"><text>规则修订 {{head.rule.version}} · 最大窗口 {{head.rule.windowDays}} 天 · 目标 {{head.rule.target}}</text><text>至少 {{head.rule.questions}} 道独立题、{{head.rule.assessments}} 次测评；最近有效证据不超过 {{head.rule.age}} 天。</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="card"><text class="heading">共同知识点证据信号</text><text>得分比例按有效独立证据守恒归集，不是学生能力概率。</text><view wx:for="{{points}}" wx:key="id"><text class="strong">{{item.code}} · {{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.ratio}}（{{item.obtained}} / {{item.max}}）</text><text>未测评 {{item.counts[0]}} · 证据不足 {{item.counts[1]}} · 需巩固 {{item.counts[2]}} · 达当前目标 {{item.counts[3]}} 人</text></view><view class="pager"><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="points" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || pointOffset === 0}}">上一页知识点</button><text>{{pointOffset + points.length}} / {{pointTotal}}</text><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="points" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || pointOffset + 20 >= pointTotal}}">下一页知识点</button></view></view>
      <view class="card"><text class="heading">本报告测评范围</text><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id"><text class="strong">{{item.title}}</text><text>原固定分配 {{item.assigned}} 人；当前纳入 {{item.visible}} 人</text><text>{{item.starts}} 至 {{item.ends}}</text></view><view class="pager"><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="tasks" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || taskOffset === 0}}">上一页测评</button><text>{{taskOffset + tasks.length}} / {{taskTotal}}</text><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="tasks" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || taskOffset + 20 >= taskTotal}}">下一页测评</button></view></view>
      <view class="card"><text class="heading">学生明细</text><view wx:for="{{students}}" wx:key="id"><text class="strong">{{item.name}} · 账号 {{item.account}}</text><text>完整评分 {{item.scoredCount}} / 分配 {{item.assignedCount}} 人次；未开始 {{item.notStartedCount}} · 缺考 {{item.absentCount}} · 待批改 {{item.pendingGradingCount}}</text><text>有有效得分依据 {{item.assessed}} / 目标范围 {{item.targets}} 个知识点；需巩固 {{item.needs}} · 证据不足 {{item.insufficient}}</text><button bindtap="student" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看这名学生的知识点与证据</button></view><view class="pager"><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="students" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || offset === 0}}">上一页学生</button><text>{{offset + students.length}} / {{total}}</text><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="students" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || offset + 20 >= total}}">下一页学生</button></view></view>
    </block>
  </block>
</view>
